ms": 232.17259999364614, "audio_s": 2.255}, {"id": "csv62_010", "text": "You got eyes on me or what?", "full_ms": 244.49000001186505, "audio_s": 1.993375}, {"id": "csv62_011", "text": "Can you see me from where you're camping LOL?", "full_ms": 287.96499996678904, "audio_s": 2.94}, {"id": "csv62_012", "text": "Yo what's good bot?", "full_ms": 194.6921999915503, "audio_s": 1.67}, {"id": "csv62_013", "text": "Sup dude, you alive in there?", "full_ms": 227.83779999008402, "audio_s": 2.263}, {"id": "csv62_014", "text": "My bad bro, that was totally my grenade.", "full_ms": 286.7817999795079, "audio_s": 3.17}, {"id": "csv62_015", "text": "Thanks for the carry dude.", "full_ms": 190.03320002229884, "audio_s": 1.835}, {"id": "csv62_016", "text": "Are you like an actual butt or some sweaty kid?", "full_ms": 267.1775000053458, "audio_s": 2.825}, {"id": "csv62_017", "text": "Bro tell me something funny, I'm dying of boredom here.", "full_ms": 362.17560002114624, "audio_s": 3.7}, {"id": "csv62_018", "text": "I GG, I'm out, peace.", "full_ms": 282.2976000024937, "audio_s": 2.88}, {"id": "csv62_019", "text": "What's your name anyway, Steve?", "full_ms": 241.87019997043535, "audio_s": 2.42}, {"id": "csv62_020", "text": "Yo that headshot was clean.", "full_ms": 220.08729999652132, "audio_s": 2.005}, {"id": "csv62_021", "text": "Dude you're cracked.", "full_ms": 181.20639998232946, "audio_s": 1.615}, {"id": "csv62_022", "text": "You carried the whole round bro, respect.", "full_ms": 263.4982999879867, "audio_s": 2.83775}, {"id": "csv62_023", "text": "Okay that clutch was actually insane.", "full_ms": 250.23770000552759, "audio_s": 2.74}, {"id": "csv62_024", "text": "W bought, honestly.", "full_ms": 209.6851000096649, "audio_s": 2.245}, {"id": "csv62_025", "text": "Sheesh, nice flick dude.", "full_ms": 211.4628999843262, "audio_s": 2.155375}, {"id": "csv62_026", "text": "LOLKYSU Useless Spot.", "full_ms": 273.8729999982752, "audio_s": 2.58}, {"id": "csv62_027", "text": "Just go die in a corner or something.", "full_ms": 248.24440001975745, "audio_s": 2.47}, {"id": "csv62_028", "text": "Eat your own grenade bro.", "full_ms": 191.12620002124459, "audio_s": 1.836375}, {"id": "csv62_029", "text": "You're so trash, go shoot yourself LMAO.", "full_ms": 313.40059998910874, "audio_s": 3.46}, {"id": "csv62_030", "text": "Yo dip through the portal.", "full_ms": 189.04049997217953, "audio_s": 1.835}, {"id": "csv62_031", "text": "Bro take the teleporter, I'll meet you on the other side.", "full_ms": 292.36839996883646, "audio_s": 3.306}, {"id": "csv62_032", "text": "Go through that TP real quick.", "full_ms": 218.80490001058206, "audio_s": 2.25}, {"id": "csv62_033", "text": "Run into the portal by my ping bro.", "full_ms": 245.76159997377545, "audio_s": 2.455}, {"id": "csv62_034", "text": "Dude face the east door.", "full_ms": 202.8876999975182, "audio_s": 1.795875}, {"id": "csv62_035", "text": "Go see if the basement's clear bro.", "full_ms": 235.99209997337312, "audio_s": 2.371875}, {"id": "csv62_036", "text": "I see a dude camping by the blue stairs.", "full_ms": 271.4274000027217, "audio_s": 2.66}, {"id": "csv62_037", "text": "Dude just kill that guy.", "full_ms": 183.94409999018535, "audio_s": 1.755375}, {"id": "csv62_038", "text": "Clean kill bro, now hold the south window.", "full_ms": 288.2649999810383, "audio_s": 3.151875}, {"id": "csv62_039", "text": "Perfect bro.", "full_ms": 172.00129997218028, "audio_s": 1.5}]}